## Attributions & Open-Source Design Engineering Inspirations

This skill synthesizes original orchestration, 10-Block quality enforcement,
WCAG/APCA contrast validation, optical high-contrast depth architecture, and
the interactive Figma-style showcase generator with design craft concepts from:

- felipebasurto/unslop-ui (MIT License, Copyright 2026 Felipe Basurto)
- jakubkrehel/make-interfaces-feel-better (MIT License, Copyright 2026 Jakub Krehel)
- pbakaus/impeccable (Apache License 2.0)
- nextlevelbuilder/ui-ux-pro-max-skill (MIT License, Copyright 2024 Next Level Builder)
- uizze/uizze (MIT / Apache 2.0 License, Copyright 2026 UIZZE)
